/*
 * ClassExpander — expands class metadata(vtable and typeinfo) into YIL constants.
 *
 * The ClassExpander lowers class-level metadata into constant YIL values. It handles:
 *
 *   - generation of vtable arrays,
 *   - generation of typeinfo tuples,
 *   - symbol-touch tracking for dependency resolution,
 *   - insertion of weak or strong symbols into the global symbol table.
 *
 * Vtables are generated only for non-abstract, non-struct classes. Typeinfo is
 * generated for all classes. Both vtable and typeinfo constants include all
 * referenced symbols(methods, destructors, ancestor typeinfo).
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::lint::expander::class_
 * @File: ymirc/lint/expander/class_.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created(YYYY-MM-DD): 2026-06-24
 * @Copyright(C) 2021–2026 GNU-Ymir
 * @License
 *   ```text
